<section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">01 / SYSTEM INSTALLATION</p>
    <h1>Install Vylen Linux</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        A minimal UEFI installation with a FAT32 EFI System Partition and an
        ext4 root filesystem.
    </p>

    <div class="callout warning">
        <strong>Warning.</strong> Replace <code>/dev/nvme0n1</code> with the
        actual target disk. Partitioning and formatting erase data on the
        selected device. <code>&lt;UUID&gt;</code> is a placeholder that must be
        replaced with the value printed by <code>blkid</code>.
    </div>
</section>

<section class="doc-grid">
    <aside class="toc">
        <p class="toc-title">Installation</p>
        <a href="#/install#partition">Partition and mount</a>
        <a href="#/install#rootfs">Install rootfs</a>
